	text: [
		"§6Steel tools§r",
		"",
		"The tools have special abilities like Vein Mining and Stunning.",
		"",
		"These can be activated by pressing V.",
		"",
		"Pressing Alt opens the abilities menu which shows all abilities and customizable presets.",
		"",
		"Steel tools have a maximum of 2 custom presets. End game tools have up to 8.",
		"",
		"",
		"§6Steel armor§r",
		"",
		"The armor provides the same protection as diamond, without the armor toughness. ",
		"It will also provide 9.8% radiation resistance.",
		"",
		"If equipped as a set, it will provide",
		"- 10% physical protection if total damage received is 2% physical.",
		"",
		"Armor in Nuclear Tech go in sets (like in Terraria), so for example a single piece of end game armor isn't as strong as a full set of Steel.",
		"",
		"Most of the defense of a set comes in the set bonus, which provides % protections."
